  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The move has little strength. Its advantage is sustainability. If enough time passes, a layer of poisonous gas covers the surroundings and keeps poisoning people and things nearby. It is easy to hurt oneself. An ordinary Gu Immortal has to protect and heal the nostrils, throat, and lungs. That weakness does not apply to an immortal zombie such as Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        678
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan takes poison breath and an ancient group strength Gu recipe. Fairy Li Shan prices poison breath at two immortal essence stones.",
      "chapters": [
        679
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "acquisition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_group_strength_gu",
        "char_fairy_li_shan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He agrees, and he obtains the killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        679
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "acquisition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Back in Hu Immortal blessed land he studies harboring malicious heart and finds similarities with poison breath. Each breath can emit accumulating poison that injures enemies, just as each heartbeat would turn blood essence into malicious will.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "research",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the light of wisdom, he fuses details of poison breath and harboring malicious heart into a new incomplete immortal move he names poison spit.",
      "chapters": [
        745
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-light-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He breathes out dark purple poisonous gas that scatters with the wind. Large numbers of wind flowers wilt on contact, and their offensive power falls. The version he uses here was modified from harboring malicious heart, uses Woman’s Heart as the core, has many flaws, and is of comparatively low value. He rarely uses it.",
      "chapters": [
        1096
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wind-flowers",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_womans_heart"
      ]
    }
